            "message": "Abandoned\n\nThere have the other solution to reach this feature. \n88430: configuration: santabarbara: configure MMC as MCTPI2CTarget in BiosPost | https://gerrit.openbmc.org/c/openbmc/entity-manager/+/88430\n88403: requester: refresh MCTP endpoints after host reaches running state | https://gerrit.openbmc.org/c/openbmc/pldm/+/88403"
